<!--
  Sparkle update feed for CleanBrowse.
  Served at https://cleanbrowse.app/appcast.xml (referenced by SUFeedURL in the app's Info.plist).

  For each release:
    1. Build + notarize the DMG as usual, and export it to ~/Desktop/CleanBrowse.dmg.
    2. Run:  node scripts/upload-dmg.mjs <version>
       (uploads to Vercel Blob, signs with Sparkle's sign_update, prints a ready-to-paste
       <enclosure> block, then deletes the Desktop DMG; token comes from .env.local)
    3. Add a new <item> ABOVE the previous ones, filling in:
         sparkle:version          = CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION (build number, must increase every release)
         sparkle:shortVersionString = MARKETING_VERSION
         enclosure                = the block printed by the script
    4. Deploy the website.
-->
